SENTINEL configuration register specs
-------------------------------------

The configuration register is an 8-bit latch.
It uses port address 00 (I/O signal /IOSEL_0X).

Only 3 bit are used for now:
bit 0 (A15SEL): used to map RAM banks as high RAM (see below)
bit 1 (A16SEL): used to map RAM banks as high RAM (see below)
bit 7 (RAMSEL): use ROM and RAM (= 0), use only RAM (= 1)
So to switch ROM out set RAMSEL to 1.

- bank 1: A15SEL = 1, A16SEL = 0 (physical address 08000-0FFFF)
- bank 2: A15SEL = 0, A16SEL = 1 (physical address 10000-17FFF)
- bank 3: A15SEL = 1, A16SEL = 1 (physical address 18000-1FFFF)

ALl addresses are given in hexadecimal notation.

Bill of materials:
- 74HC273 octal latch
- 1x DIP-20 socket (optional)
- 1x capacitor 100 nF

